 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "One unit: the reciter joins 96→102 (about 167 s). «مكر الله» (99) carries Al-Muyassar's «وإمهاله لهم; استدراجًا» (As-Sa'di's wording quotes «من حيث لا يعلمون»); no motif there. Growth for «بركات من السماء والأرض», night and day for «بياتا», a book for «نقص عليك من أنبائها». No destruction drawn. First-person «فأخذناهم… أصبناهم… نختم» not used. STAGING v4: c1 (96): the people of the towns (three faceless men in dark robes) in a town by day. 96:1-12 is a counterfactual (had they believed), so nothing of it is acted: no blessing event, only a growth plate as a symbol (96:9-12) and the camera to the sky on 96:11; on 96:13-14 (but they denied) the camera is on them, they turn and leave on 96:14, so the darkness on 96:15 (He seized them) falls on the empty town. c2 (97-99): the people of the towns heedless in a market by day (Al-Muyassar: heedless, busy with their worldly affairs): night and day plate for by night while asleep (97:7-8); on 98:7-9 (at forenoon while at play) they trade, one pays a merchant (give) and the merchant talks; no punishment is drawn (these are questions and warnings); geometric for the plan of Allah (99:2-3); the camera on them for the losers (99:9). c3 (100-102), by day (no low red sun over the warnings): those who inherited the land (three men in dark robes): the camera on them (100:4); 100:12 (if We willed, We would strike them) is conditional, so no event; a seal plate for We seal their hearts (100:14-16), the camera on them for they do not hear (100:17; no gesture inside the negated clause); a book plate for those towns, We relate their news to you (101:1-6), held wide (no pan) on 101:1-6, as it is addressed to the Prophet; they shake their heads on 101:15 (they denied before). 102: two believers come in on 102:1 (As-Sa'di: only few obeyed) and the camera holds on the majority for most of them (102:3, 102:8), a scroll plate for covenant (102:5-6); they turn on 102:9 (defiantly disobedient). The messengers of 101:9 are not drawn."
 },
